DESCRIPTION:We are starting to knock doors to talk to voters about Randy V
 illegas and his campaign for Congress. We need your help! Join us to have 
 conversations with voters about our people powered campaign to fight for w
 orking families over billionaires. Following the passage of Prop 50\, Fres
 no is now in CD22. We will be hosting a series of canvasses in and around 
 Fresno through June 2nd. Please click on all canvass slots that you will a
 ttend. Once you sign up\, we will send you more information about lodg
LOCATION:Fresno\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/randyvillegas/event/911891/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
